# Keep AGENTS.md current

When you change any of the following, update [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) in the **same** change:

- Packages under `packages/`
- Components under `esphome/components/`
- External speaker / TTS playback path (`external_announce`, `play_on_external_speaker`, announce/ducking, Responding lifecycle)
- Commands, local test harness, or `${respeaker_ref}` / external_components wiring
- Layout or architecture that agents need to know

Do not leave outdated claims in `AGENTS.md`. Prefer short, actionable updates over long prose. `AGENTS.md` is the Cursor source of truth; do not rely on `CLAUDE.md` alone.
